/*!

*\page while While loop
*
* This instruction repeatedly executes a statement or block of statements until the condition becomes false. The test takes place before each iteration.<BR>

*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>
*<B> while (logical condition) { ... block of code } </B><BR>
*
* <span style='color:blue'><em><B> Example:</B> </em> </span><br>
* i=0;<br>
*<span style='color:green'> rem infinite repeat </span><br>
* while(1){<br>
* &nbsp; aput PA_4,  i;		&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  <span style='color:green'> rem send the value to Analog Output port PA_4</span><br>
* &nbsp; i=i+0.1;<br>
* &nbsp; if( i==1)<br>
* &nbsp;{<br>
	&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i=0;
*&nbsp; }
*
*}
*
*/
